# Data Vault vs dimensional modeling

## Not rivals — **different jobs**

```
                 Dimensional (star)   Data Vault
Optimized for    query & reporting    integration & loading
Structure        denormalized, few    normalized, many tables
History          SCD (bolted on)      native (satellites)
Agility          low                  high
Query perf       fast, simple         slow, many joins
Audience         analysts, BI         ETL / engineering
Auditability     limited              full (source + time)
```

## The resolution — **layer** them

```
sources → DATA VAULT (raw integration, system of record)
                    → STAR marts (query layer) → BI
```
- Vault = **integrate & preserve** · star = **present & query**
- Star's rigidity stops mattering — you can **rebuild** it from the vault
